WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.497
In numbers,

00:00:04.577 --> 00:00:09.074
G-Delta-UQ is a single-model method offering three
anchoring variants plus a pretrained partial-stochasticity option.

00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:13.651
It is evaluated across three distinct types of
distribution shift and three safety-critical downstream tasks,

00:00:13.731 --> 00:00:18.229
and compared against four established uncertainty
baselines including deep ensembles.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:22.806
Despite requiring only a single model,

00:00:22.886 --> 00:00:27.383
it consistently matches or outperforms these
baselines on calibration,

00:00:27.463 --> 00:00:31.960
out-of-distribution detection, and generalization
gap prediction.
